:"chosen","p":"N","tr":"mukh'laṣan","f":["PASS","PCPL","(IV)","M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":299,"l":912},{"i":"19:51:8","a":"وَكَانَ","t":"and was","p":"V","tr":"wakāna","f":["PERF","3MS"],"r":2,"l":9,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["كَانَ","V","stem","PERF|3MS"]]},{"i":"19:51:9","a":"رَسُولًۭا","t":"a Messenger","p":"N","tr":"rasūlan","f":["M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":11,"l":35},{"i":"19:51:10","a":"نَّبِيًّۭا","t":"a Prophet","p":"N","tr":"nabiyyan","f":["M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":68,"l":156},{"e":"٥١","v":"19:51"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"19:39","t":"And warn them, [O Muḥammad], of the Day of Regret, when the matter will be concluded; and [yet], they are in [a state of] heedlessness, and they do not believe.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"19:40","t":"Indeed, it is We who will inherit the earth and whoever is on it, and to Us they will be returned.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"19:41","t":"And mention in the Book [the story of] Abraham. Indeed, he was a man of truth and a prophet.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"19:42","t":"[Mention] when he said to his father, \"O my father, why do you worship that which does not hear and does not see and will not benefit you at all?","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"19:43","t":"O my father, indeed there has come to me of knowledge that which has not come to you, so follow me; I will guide you to an even path.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"19:44","t":"O my father, do not worship [i.e., obey] Satan. Indeed Satan has ever been, to the Most Merciful, disobedient.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"19:45","t":"O my father, indeed I fear that there will touch you a punishment from the Most Merciful so you would be to Satan a companion [in Hellfire].\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"19:46","t":"[His father] said, \"Have you no desire for my gods, O Abraham? If you do not desist, I will surely stone you, so avoid me a prolonged time.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"19:47","t":"[Abraham] said, \"Peace [i.e., safety] will be upon you. I will ask forgiveness for you of my Lord. Indeed, He is ever gracious to me.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"19:48","t":"And I will leave you and those you invoke other than Allāh and will invoke my Lord. I expect that I will not be in invocation to my Lord unhappy [i.e., disappointed].\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"19:49","t":"So when he had left them and those they worshipped other than Allāh, We gave him Isaac and Jacob, and each [of them] We made a prophet.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"19:50","t":"And We gave them of Our mercy, and We made for them a mention [i.e., reputation] of high honor.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"19:51","t":"And mention in the Book, Moses. Indeed, he was chosen, and he was a messenger and a prophet.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":51,"sd":null}],"juz":16,"hizb":31,"surahs":[19],"sajdah":false}